      "slides": [
        {
          "title": "Drawing & Sharing Plans",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>ATAK has the military drawing tools you need. First off, head to Main Menu (hamburger).</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/64805fb53e2f9091.webp",
              "width": 2340,
              "height": 1080
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Choose Drawing Tools",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Look for the Drawing Tools symbol.</li>\n<li>If that doesn't appear in your menu, hit the yellowish Pen and activate the Drawing Tools in your menu.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/290e2d69343f71ff.webp",
              "width": 2340,
              "height": 1080
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Drawing Toolset",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Select the tool that suits your need.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/34645de4727b037d.webp",
              "width": 2340,
              "height": 1080
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Drawing a Marching Route (1)",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>In our example we draw a marching route using the Point-by-point line tool.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/0a4cc7a796110cd6.webp",
              "width": 2340,
              "height": 1080
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Drawing a Marching Route (2)",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/5022607bb448e50b.webp",
              "width": 2340,
              "height": 1080
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Drawing a Marching Route (3)",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>We press End to finalize the shape.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/91f711a157b3211f.webp",
              "width": 2340,
              "height": 1080
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Edit & View Details",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Tap the shape to open the menu. Press the Edit icon to edit the details.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/0227e6ec3eb8af18.webp",
              "width": 2340,
              "height": 1080
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Viewing Details",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Useful for a marching route, display the length of the line.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/4aec2c6d6b1c6305.webp",
              "width": 2340,
              "height": 1080
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Editing a Shape",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Scroll down in the Edit menu to change line color, thickness and style.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/e53b25d163eb7f4f.webp",
              "width": 2340,
              "height": 1080
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Other Tools",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Aside of Drawing Tools, the Point Dropper also has other symbols than military for your convenience.</li>\n<li>Use eg. \"Spot Map\" icon set to draw points.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/29b64f26a183afb7.webp",
              "width": 2340,
              "height": 1080
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Done",
          "layout": "text",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>You can close this guide.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p>After successful testing Draw &#x26; share Plans, continue to <a href=\"/doc/7df31ecb-1092-4d8c-9013-b168feec84ba\">Geofences</a></p>"
